---
/**
 * ConferenceEventHeader
 *
 * Renders the header for multi-page conference events that follow the header.md convention.
 * The insert contains a banner image (full-width conference hero) and a horizontal nav strip.
 *
 * CONVENTION: any event with content/events/{root}/header.md gets this layout automatically
 * when rendered through the [..slug].astro event template. Future conferences just need to
 * create that file — no code changes required.
 *
 * Usage:
 *   <ConferenceEventHeader>
 *     <HeaderContent />   ← the rendered header insert component (banner + nav)
 *   </ConferenceEventHeader>
 *
 * The insert is expected to render:
 *   1. A banner image (linked to the conference home page)
 *   2. A .linkbox-horizontal div with navigation links separated by "|" pipes
 *
 * CSS for this component lives in bootstrap-compat.css under .conf-event-header.
 * All visual customisation happens there — this component is intentionally minimal.
 */
---
<header class="conf-event-header not-prose" role="banner">
  <slot />
</header>
